flowchart TD
    F0[Accepted framework N] --> W[Framework work item]
    K[Framework requirements + current ProjectBlueprint] --> W
    W --> P[Planner Blueprint/Plan revision]
    P --> Q[Provider + Tester + Coder feasibility]
    Q --> H[Human approval package]
    H --> C[Candidate framework N+1 in isolated worktree]
    C --> T[Candidate/self tests + independent verification]
    T --> R{Acceptance satisfied?}
    R -- No --> D[Diagnose / replan / repair]
    D --> W
    R -- Yes --> M[Promotion using stable/recovery boundary]
    M --> F1[Accepted framework N+1]
    F1 --> A[Reconcile current architecture + project knowledge]
